commit 8403fb28b1bc259c7d816e67602f1384634fab33
Author: Devlin Cronin <rdevlin.cronin@chromium.org>
Date:   Wed May 27 16:29:02 2026 -0700

    [Extensions] Remove old MV2 phase handling in developerPrivate
    
    Remove now-unnecessary handling in the developerPrivate API for pieces
    of the MV2 deprecation. Since this has been fully launched for >1 year,
    we no longer need the old UI implementations or individual extension
    acknowledgement.
    
    This CL should have no behavior change in practice, since the removed
    UIs are not actively shown to any users today.
    
    Bug: 431097630
    Change-Id: I2757555eae0be80df284abc372bd8e00e365b3a3
    Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/7876097
    Reviewed-by: Kelvin Jiang <kelvinjiang@chromium.org>
    Reviewed-by: Demetrios Papadopoulos <dpapad@chromium.org>
    Auto-Submit: Devlin Cronin <rdevlin.cronin@chromium.org>
    Commit-Queue: Devlin Cronin <rdevlin.cronin@chromium.org>
    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1637322}

